    "scope": "Historical TDG earnings and quality review. USD millions except percentages, percentage points and multiples. The earnings comparison is fiscal Q1 2024-10-01–2024-12-28 (89 days) versus 2023-10-01–2023-12-30 (91 days). Quality/cash-conversion/leverage tables use FY2024 and September 30, 2024 balances unless explicitly labelled quarterly. Quality-adjusted EBITDA is unresolved; 24,961 is only a known-item debt subtotal. Guidance, matching LTM ratios and current cash access remain unestablished. Eight selected sections plus complete retained handoffs/evidence; replay publication, not a fresh model run or full pathway/native acceptance. CP-5A permits restricted historical analytical use with two inherited Material limitations: source coverage and the unresolved distribution disclosure difference. The exact review is under CP-5/Evidence. No overall credit decision or unrestricted committee use is cleared."
